      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi, this is great work, and logically correct.  Can we make some small alterations to make this work more re-usable across different aiTypes, and also to force the decision about what headers etc, look like when using MISTRAL.  As such see my recommendations to make this a new aiType and to use new ChatRequest classes for the serialized data to make it clear what is being used at any one time.",
