      "message": "What should Mistral use for headers by default, as its not discussed.  What aiType did you have set, was it the default CHATGPT, or something else.  I believe once you add the new aiType\u003dMISTRAL, search for all current uses of getAIType() so that you can force decisions about what other behaviours this provider requires.  GEMINI is also extremely close to MISTRAL and i will be adding its aiType as soon as I can also.",
      "revId": "dc05bc5f66c8726ff3ef2949ab14cb1f4edfde9c",
